exports[`AccountDeletedEmail > matches the plain text body 1`] = `
"SAD TO
SEE YOU GO

We received your request to delete your pencil case account. In 30 days we permanently delete your account and your documents.

Until then you can always restore it. Sign in with this e-mail address by 23 December 2026 and your account is back, with all your documents.

Restore account https://docs.pencilcase.app/signin"
`;

